Z||000000||Janson||07-06-2001||11:54 PM||||Hey there. Yeah, I'm new to the forums. Actually, I posted once here a looooong time ago. Anyway, I just inherited my very first Fiero! It's a 1986 SE. And though I am new to the world of cars, that's not stopping me from planning out a long-term project for my new love.<P>This project being some heavily modded doors. I just need some accurate schematics so I can plan and exicute it properly. So, I hope I came to the right place.<P>Thanks. And I appreciate any assistance you all can give me.<P>------------------<BR>- Janson||||reg||2
